program	vis80_field_literal_error.saw
triple	arm64-apple-darwin
twin	same
expect	error
build	refused	field `secret` of struct `Gadget` is private and not accessible from this module
meets_expect	yes
log	"error: field `secret` of struct `Gadget` is private and not accessible from this module"
log	"  --> examples/vis80_field_literal_error.saw:8:22"
log	"    |"
log	" 8 |     let g = members80.Gadget(label: 1, secret: 2)   // memberwise literal — rejected"
log	"    |                      ^"
log	"   hint: mark it `public` in the declaration of `Gadget` to expose it"
log	""
log	"1 error(s) generated"
